{"seq":3,"slug":"color-balance","title":"色彩平衡还原与肤色保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/color-correction/color-balance","wordCount":1927,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"色彩平衡还原与肤色保护\">色彩平衡还原与肤色保护</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>色彩平衡在白平衡之后进一步精细分工，其核心要点如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分区域精细化</strong>：白平衡是&quot;全局中性化&quot;，色彩平衡则分别调整暗部、中间调、高光三个亮度区域的色彩倾向。</li>\n<li><strong>色偏有物理成因</strong>：暗部偏蓝源于天光散射，暗部偏绿源于荧光/LED 光谱不连续，理解成因才能对症修正。</li>\n<li><strong>Vectorscope 判读</strong>：中心点偏移=全局色偏，分布偏象限=区域色偏，肤色线偏移=肤色失真。</li>\n<li><strong>肤色优先</strong>：人眼对肤色极其敏感，HSL Qualifier 可隔离肤色区域单独修正，关键是&quot;先全局调色，后保护肤色&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>多机位一致性</strong>：通过色卡匹配、肤色对齐、亮度与对比度匹配，把不同摄影机素材统一到同一风格。</li>\n<li><strong>色彩管理加持</strong>：ACES 与 DaVinci Wide Gamut 通过 IDT 自动转换统一各机位色彩空间，大幅降低手动平衡工作量。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"色彩平衡的技术定义\">色彩平衡的技术定义</h2><p>色彩平衡（Color Balance）是在白平衡校正之后，进一步精细调整画面中不同亮度区域的色彩倾向，确保暗部、中间调和高光区域都呈现预期的色彩状态。如果说白平衡是&quot;全局中性化&quot;，色彩平衡则是&quot;分区域精细化&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;色彩平衡三区域模型&quot;&#10;        SHADOW[暗部 Shadows/Lift]&#10;        MID[中间调 Midtones/Gamma]&#10;        HIGH[高光 Highlights/Gain]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;常见偏色问题&quot;&#10;        SHADOW --&gt; S1[&quot;暗部偏蓝 - 日光阴影&quot;]&#10;        SHADOW --&gt; S2[&quot;暗部偏绿 - 荧光灯残余&quot;]&#10;        MID --&gt; M1[&quot;中间调偏黄 - 钨丝灯&quot;]&#10;        HIGH --&gt; H1[&quot;高光偏品红 - LED 灯光谱缺陷&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"色彩平衡三区域模型\"\n        SHADOW[暗部 Shadows/Lift]\n        MID[中间调 Midtones/Gamma]\n        HIGH[高光 Highlights/Gain]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"常见偏色问题\"\n        SHADOW --&gt; S1[\"暗部偏蓝 - 日光阴影\"]\n        SHADOW --&gt; S2[\"暗部偏绿 - 荧光灯残余\"]\n        MID --&gt; M1[\"中间调偏黄 - 钨丝灯\"]\n        HIGH --&gt; H1[\"高光偏品红 - LED 灯光谱缺陷\"]\n    end</pre><p>色彩平衡使用色轮（Color Wheels）工具操作：在 Lift/Gamma/Gain 色轮内拖动中心点，即向画面对应亮度区域添加或减去特定色相。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分区域色偏成因\">分区域色偏成因</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域</th>\n<th>常见色偏</th>\n<th>物理原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暗部偏蓝</td>\n<td>蓝色残留</td>\n<td>天光散射（瑞利散射）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暗部偏绿</td>\n<td>绿色残留</td>\n<td>荧光灯/LED 光谱不连续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间调偏黄</td>\n<td>暖调整体</td>\n<td>钨丝灯环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高光偏品红</td>\n<td>品红倾向</td>\n<td>LED 光源蓝峰+红磷组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局偏青</td>\n<td>青色蒙版</td>\n<td>错误的 LUT 或色彩空间转换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>色彩平衡校正</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>G</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{色彩平衡校正} = \\sum_{zone \\in \\{L,G,H\\}} \\Delta C_{zone} \\times W_{zone}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">色彩平衡校正</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta C_{zone}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是各区域的色彩偏移量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{zone}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是基于亮度的区域权重函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"vectorscope-分析与校正\">Vectorscope 分析与校正</h2><h3 id=\"vectorscope-判读\">Vectorscope 判读</h3><p>Vectorscope（矢量示波器）是判断色彩平衡的核心工具，显示画面色度信息在色彩空间中的分布：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Vectorscope 特征</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>处理方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>中心点偏移</td>\n<td>全局色偏</td>\n<td>白平衡修正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布偏向某象限</td>\n<td>区域性色偏</td>\n<td>色轮修正对应区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超出 75% 标线</td>\n<td>色彩过饱和</td>\n<td>降低饱和度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>肤色线偏移</td>\n<td>肤色失真</td>\n<td>二次校正肤色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>紧凑圆形分布</td>\n<td>色彩平衡良好</td>\n<td>无需修正</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Vectorscope 上的&quot;肤色线&quot;（Skin Tone Line）是从圆心向约 11 点钟方向（黄-红之间）延伸的参考线。无论人种、肤色深浅，人类皮肤在 Vectorscope 上的色度方向高度一致——都落在这条线附近。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>肤色方向角</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>123</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo>±</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>标准 Vectorscope 坐标</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{肤色方向角} \\approx 123° \\pm 10°\\ (\\text{标准 Vectorscope 坐标})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">肤色方向角</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">123°</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10°</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">标准</span><span class=\"mord\"> Vectorscope </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">坐标</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"实操-三步色彩平衡法\">实操：三步色彩平衡法</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>暗部平衡</strong>：找到画面中应为纯黑/深灰的区域，观察 Parade 示波器底部三通道是否对齐</li>\n<li><strong>高光平衡</strong>：找到画面中应为纯白/亮灰的区域，观察 Parade 顶部三通道对齐</li>\n<li><strong>中间调微调</strong>：在前两步完成后，观察 Vectorscope 整体分布是否中心化</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    STEP1[&quot;Step 1: Lift 色轮\\n暗部中性化&quot;] --&gt; STEP2[&quot;Step 2: Gain 色轮\\n高光中性化&quot;]&#10;    STEP2 --&gt; STEP3[&quot;Step 3: Gamma 色轮\\n中间调微调&quot;]&#10;    STEP3 --&gt; CHECK[&quot;Vectorscope 验证\\n分布居中&quot;]\">graph LR\n    STEP1[\"Step 1: Lift 色轮\\n暗部中性化\"] --&gt; STEP2[\"Step 2: Gain 色轮\\n高光中性化\"]\n    STEP2 --&gt; STEP3[\"Step 3: Gamma 色轮\\n中间调微调\"]\n    STEP3 --&gt; CHECK[\"Vectorscope 验证\\n分布居中\"]</pre><h2 id=\"肤色保护技术\">肤色保护技术</h2><h3 id=\"肤色的特殊地位\">肤色的特殊地位</h3><p>人眼对肤色的敏感度远超其他色彩——即使整体画面色彩有明显偏移，只要肤色看起来自然，观众通常不会感到违和。反之，即使画面整体平衡，不自然的肤色会立刻引起不适。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>肤色特征</th>\n<th>技术指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>色相范围</td>\n<td>20°-45°（HSL 色相轮）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>饱和度范围</td>\n<td>30%-60%（因人种而异）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vectorscope 方向</td>\n<td>紧贴肤色线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lab a* 范围</td>\n<td>8-25（浅肤色）/ 15-35（深肤色）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lab b* 范围</td>\n<td>10-30（黄色方向）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"hsl-qualifier-肤色隔离\">HSL Qualifier 肤色隔离</h3><p>在 DaVinci Resolve 中使用 HSL Qualifier 隔离肤色区域：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>推荐范围</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Hue</td>\n<td>15°-50°</td>\n<td>选中黄-橙-红肤色范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Saturation</td>\n<td>25%-75%</td>\n<td>排除灰色和过饱和区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Luminance</td>\n<td>20%-85%</td>\n<td>排除极暗/极亮区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Softness</td>\n<td>适中</td>\n<td>确保选区边缘自然过渡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Qualifier 选区</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Qualifier 选区} = H_{match} \\cap S_{match} \\cap L_{match}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Qualifier </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">选区</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"肤色校正策略\">肤色校正策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>校正手段</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>肤色偏绿</td>\n<td>Hue vs Hue 曲线：绿向红偏移</td>\n<td>Curves</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>肤色过饱和</td>\n<td>降低选区内 Saturation</td>\n<td>Qualifier + Sat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>肤色暗沉</td>\n<td>提升选区内 Gamma</td>\n<td>Qualifier + Lift/Gamma</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>肤色不均</td>\n<td>Spatial NR + Soft Light</td>\n<td>降噪 + 混合模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红斑/痘印</td>\n<td>Hue vs Sat：降低红色高饱和</td>\n<td>Curves</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;肤色保护节点链&quot;&#10;        N1[&quot;Node 1: 全局白平衡/色彩平衡&quot;]&#10;        N2[&quot;Node 2: 创意调色 LUT&quot;]&#10;        N3[&quot;Node 3: 肤色隔离 (Qualifier)&quot;]&#10;        N4[&quot;Node 3 内: 独立肤色微调&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    N1 --&gt; N2 --&gt; N3&#10;    N3 --&gt; N4\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"肤色保护节点链\"\n        N1[\"Node 1: 全局白平衡/色彩平衡\"]\n        N2[\"Node 2: 创意调色 LUT\"]\n        N3[\"Node 3: 肤色隔离 (Qualifier)\"]\n        N4[\"Node 3 内: 独立肤色微调\"]\n    end\n\n    N1 --&gt; N2 --&gt; N3\n    N3 --&gt; N4</pre><p>关键原则：<strong>先全局调色，后保护肤色</strong>。在创意 LUT 应用之后，独立节点中隔离肤色并微调回自然范围，确保整体风格和肤色自然并存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"镜头匹配与一致性\">镜头匹配与一致性</h2><h3 id=\"多机位色彩匹配\">多机位色彩匹配</h3><p>同一场景使用多台摄影机拍摄时，由于传感器差异、镜头涂层和白平衡设置不同，素材间存在色彩偏差。一致性匹配流程：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>匹配步骤</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 色卡匹配</td>\n<td>建立各机位的校正矩阵</td>\n<td>Color Checker Match</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 肤色对齐</td>\n<td>统一肤色方向</td>\n<td>Vectorscope 参考</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 亮度匹配</td>\n<td>统一曝光电平</td>\n<td>Waveform 对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 对比度匹配</td>\n<td>统一反差风格</td>\n<td>Curve 对比</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DaVinci Resolve 提供自动镜头匹配功能：右键目标片段 → &quot;Shot Match to This Clip&quot;，软件自动分析色彩/亮度差异并应用补偿。</p>\n<h3 id=\"色彩一致性的量化指标\">色彩一致性的量化指标</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>匹配误差</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>00</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>参考帧</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>目标帧</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{匹配误差} = \\Delta E_{00}(\\text{参考帧}, \\text{目标帧})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">匹配误差</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">00</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">参考帧</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标帧</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于广播质量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>00</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta E_{00} &lt; 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">00</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>（同场景不同镜头间）。对于电影质量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>00</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta E_{00} &lt; 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">00</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>实际工作流中，使用 Gallery 保存参考 Still（静帧），并在 Wipe 模式下逐帧对比确认匹配精度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"色彩管理系统中的平衡\">色彩管理系统中的平衡</h2><h3 id=\"aces-与-davinci-wide-gamut\">ACES 与 DaVinci Wide Gamut</h3><p>现代色彩管理系统（ACES、DaVinci Wide Gamut）在色彩平衡方面提供了天然优势：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>色彩管理模式</th>\n<th>平衡方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无管理 (手动)</td>\n<td>手动 Lift/Gamma/Gain</td>\n<td>灵活但费时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DaVinci YRGB</td>\n<td>手动 + CST 辅助</td>\n<td>平衡性好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DaVinci WG/Intermediate</td>\n<td>自动输入转换</td>\n<td>多机位天然统一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ACES (ACEScct)</td>\n<td>IDT 自动统一</td>\n<td>最佳一致性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 ACES 或 DaVinci Wide Gamut 工作流中，不同摄影机的素材通过 Input Transform（IDT）自动转换到统一色彩空间，大幅减少手动色彩平衡的工作量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ACES 流程</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>Camera</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>ACEScct</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>调色</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>ACEScct</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>显示</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ACES 流程}: \\text{Camera} \\xrightarrow{IDT} \\text{ACEScct} \\xrightarrow{\\text{调色}} \\text{ACEScct} \\xrightarrow{ODT} \\text{显示}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ACES </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">流程</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Camera</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ACEScct</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">调色</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ACEScct</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">显示</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>截至 2026 年，ACES 2.0 已正式发布，改进了色调映射算法并解决了 ACES 1.x 中红色/肤色偏移的已知问题，使得色彩平衡在色彩管理框架内更加可靠。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>色彩平衡在白平衡建立中性基础之后，按暗部、中间调、高光三个亮度区域做精细化的色彩修正。各区域色偏都有其物理成因，用色轮与 Vectorscope 可据此对症调整。肤色是其中最高优先级的对象——借助 HSL Qualifier 隔离肤色区域独立修正，遵循&quot;先全局、后肤色&quot;的原则，能同时保住整体风格与肤色自然。多机位场景下，色彩平衡还承担镜头匹配职责，通过色卡、肤色、亮度、对比度四步对齐保证一致性，并以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>00</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta E_{00}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">00</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 作为量化指标。ACES 与 DaVinci Wide Gamut 等色彩管理体系进一步通过 IDT 自动统一各机位色彩空间，减少手动平衡负担。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"色彩平衡还原与肤色保护","id":"色彩平衡还原与肤色保护"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"色彩平衡的技术定义","id":"色彩平衡的技术定义"},{"level":3,"text":"分区域色偏成因","id":"分区域色偏成因"},{"level":2,"text":"Vectorscope 分析与校正","id":"vectorscope-分析与校正"},{"level":3,"text":"Vectorscope 判读","id":"vectorscope-判读"},{"level":3,"text":"实操：三步色彩平衡法","id":"实操-三步色彩平衡法"},{"level":2,"text":"肤色保护技术","id":"肤色保护技术"},{"level":3,"text":"肤色的特殊地位","id":"肤色的特殊地位"},{"level":3,"text":"HSL Qualifier 肤色隔离","id":"hsl-qualifier-肤色隔离"},{"level":3,"text":"肤色校正策略","id":"肤色校正策略"},{"level":2,"text":"镜头匹配与一致性","id":"镜头匹配与一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"多机位色彩匹配","id":"多机位色彩匹配"},{"level":3,"text":"色彩一致性的量化指标","id":"色彩一致性的量化指标"},{"level":2,"text":"色彩管理系统中的平衡","id":"色彩管理系统中的平衡"},{"level":3,"text":"ACES 与 DaVinci Wide Gamut","id":"aces-与-davinci-wide-gamut"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"曝光与对比度修正","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/color-correction/exposure-contrast"},"next":{"title":"LUT 原理与应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/creative-grading/lut"}}